    <!-- Injuries and pauses -->
    <string name="tra_injuries_title">Injuries &amp; pauses</string>
    <string name="tra_injuries_info_title">How injury mode works</string>
    <string name="tra_injuries_info_text">Note an injury and CruxCoach adapts: exercises that load the injured area are hidden or marked, one-sided exercises stay available for the healthy side (for example one-arm pick-ups on the right hand while a left finger heals), and wall climbing can be paused. This is a filter, not a treatment plan. Return to load step by step and with professional advice.</string>
